{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52621","headline":"琼州（题拟） · 沈佺期","name":"琼州（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异哉寸波中，露此横海脊。\n举首玉簪插，忽去银钉掷。\n身大何时见，夭矫翔霹雳。\n铜柱威丹徼，朱崖镇火陬。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷一二四《琼州》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52621.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52621","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}